            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindi M Bauer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Always a great tasting sandwich!! Sometimes I toast my bread, and sometimes I'll add Nutella Sread, Marshmallow Creme and Peanut Butter to 2 slices of bread. Mmm... yum!! Makes for a great tasting sandwich!! Sarah, thanx for posting this recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-05-29T09:05:47.423Z"
